      "caption": "i've been using my MacBook Neo for a week now, and honestly… i get why everyone’s talking about it. RM2499 (256GB, 8GB RAM) — got RM200 discount!🎀 what i like: •design is super sleek and lightweight — really easy to carry around • battery life is actually impressive, I barely worry about charging it during the day • it feels really smooth for everyday use!! (browsing, notes, streaming, editing docs, multitasking)  • the display looks really clean and bright • for the price, it genuinely feels premium and doesn’t feel “cheap” at all, which surprised me!! what i kinda don't like: • no backlit keyboard — not really a big deal for me, but would’ve been a nice extra, you know what i meannnn??? • limited ports, so adapters might be needed depending on what you use • base storage might feel small if you save a lot of files/photos • not meant for super heavy editing or gaming after using it for a week, i’d say it’s definitely worth it for everyday use. it’s fast, looks really nice, and feels premium without being crazy expensive. perfect if you want something reliable for school, work, or casual use!💗🫧 if you have questions, slide on dms!💌 @Machines Official Store  #pinkthings #pinkmacbook #fyp #macbookneo #apple ",
